# Written for this pack by BurN-30 (GPL-3.0). Quest ids, givers, levels, prerequisites, drops
# and rewards from Polestar's Forever data (data-v2026.11.1: QuestieDB Forever, the 1.60.1 client,
# and Polestar's corrections, whose Gnomeregan XP comes from players' Forever caches) and its
# Dungeons codex (boss order: Grubbis, Viscous Fallout, Electrocutioner 6000, Crowd Pummeler 9-60,
# Mekgineer Thermaplugg); prerequisites cross-checked with the TrinityCore Forever world base
# (2026-10-14). Places and how-to from two WoW Forever quest guides, read on 12/11/2026 and
# rewritten: Warcraft Tavern (warcrafttavern.com/forever/guides/gnomeregan-quests, 11/11/2026) and
# Icy Veins (icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnomeregan-quests, 05/10/2026). They agree: Techbot and
# Matrix Punchograph 3005-A stand outside the portal, B in the Dormitory south of the Clean Room
# (Viscous Fallout), C on the Launch Bay (Electrocutioner 6000), D on the lower level of the
# Engineering Labs (Crowd Pummeler 9-60); Kernobee waits in the Dormitory, before Viscous Fallout;
# the Sparklematic machines stand in the room before the Dormitory; the Gnogaine phial fills on the
# corpse of an irradiated trogg; the High Potency Radioactive Fallout lasts two hours. Wowhead
# Forever could not be read (robot check). Not played in game yet.
#
# Optional chapter: asked once at Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind, at the start of Group 9
# (`when group 2928`, 11-mille-pointes); every later step needs `when done gno-start`. Skipped:
# the whole chapter is left out and Dalaran follows. The Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962) has
# its own question (`when group 2962`): a return to Kharanos before the run.
#
# Prerequisites (Polestar's compiled guide, TrinityCore base): Gnogaine (2926) after The Day After
# (2927); The Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962) after Gnogaine; Save Techbot's Brain (2922),
# Essential Artificials (2924) and Data Rescue (2930) have only errands before them (Brother Sarno
# 2923, Mathiel 2925, Gaxim 2931), which the compiler drops and this chapter does not need. Return
# of the Ring (2947) after Grime-Encrusted Ring (2945), a drop.
# Left out: the Sparklematic 5200 boxes (2951 and its variants: three silver per Grime-Encrusted
# Object, a random box), Gnome Improvement (2948, after Return of the Ring: a Silver Bar, a Moss
# Agate and 30 silver).
#
# Flow: Ironforge (Tinker Town) -> Kharanos (Ozzie) -> the Gnomeregan outskirts (Gnogaine,
# Techbot, the white card and Punchograph A) -> [Kharanos and back, Green Glow] -> the dungeon ->
# Kharanos (Ozzie) -> Ironforge rewards -> Stormwind (Shoni), where Group 11 (Dalaran) starts. A
# Fine Mess (2904) is handed in at Booty Bay in Group 15.
guide groupe-alliance/10b-gnomeregan
title Group 10b · Gnomeregan (dungeon 29-33, optional)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 30-33
zone Ironforge
next groupe-alliance/12-dalaran

step Ironforge: Gnomeregan quests
  label gno-start
  when group 2928
  when level<36
  zone Ironforge
  tip Gnomeregan: a 5-player dungeon under Dun Morogh, best at 29 to 33; Mekgineer Thermaplugg, the last boss, is 34. Every quest giver stands in Tinker Town. From the Wetlands: fly from Menethil Harbor to Ironforge. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on to Dalaran.
  note Keep 9 free quest log slots. Every quest can be shared except Gnogaine and its follow-up: each player takes those from Ozzie.
  accept 2929                                 -- High Tinker Mekkatorque
  accept 2930                                 -- Master Mechanic Castpipe
  turnin 2923 optional                        -- Tinkmaster Overspark: Brother Sarno's errand, if you took it in Stormwind
  accept 2922                                 -- Tinkmaster Overspark
  accept 2927                                 -- Gnoarn: for Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos
  accept 2924 optional                        -- Klockmort Spannerspan: not offered without Mathiel's errand from Darnassus? Carry on without it

step Kharanos: Ozzie Togglevolt
  when done gno-start
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Ride out of Ironforge down to Kharanos. Ozzie hands you an Empty Leaden Collection Phial.
  turnin 2927                                 -- Ozzie Togglevolt
  accept 2926

step The Gnomeregan outskirts
  when done gno-start
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip West of Kharanos, the paths down to the dungeon's portal, outside the instance. Kill an Irradiated Invader (green glow, elite 24) and use the Empty Leaden Collection Phial on its corpse. Techbot (elite 26) has his own room off the northern part of these paths: his Memory Core drops for every player on the quest.
  tip Data Rescue starts out here too: the White Punch Card drops from the troggs and lepers of the outskirts (about 1 kill in 10), and Matrix Punchograph 3005-A, a machine also outside the portal, turns it into a Yellow Punch Card.
  collect 9284 quest 2926 @19.5,37.8          -- Full Leaden Collection Phial: the empty phial, on an Irradiated Invader's corpse
  collect 9277 quest 2922 @19.78,31.93        -- Techbot's Memory Core: Techbot, elite 26
  collect 9279 optional                       -- White Punch Card: troggs and lepers
  collect 9280 optional                       -- Yellow Punch Card: the White one, at Matrix Punchograph 3005-A

step Kharanos: The Only Cure is More Green Glow (optional detour)
  when done gno-start
  when group 2962
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Gnogaine is done outside the dungeon, so it can be handed in now: back to Kharanos, then back to the portal, about two rides of a couple of minutes. Ozzie's next quest is done inside: use his Heavy Leaden Collection Phial on a LIVING irradiated slime or horror, and the fallout lasts two hours, enough for the run and the ride back. Not each player's cup of tea? Skip it: Gnogaine is handed in after the run.
  turnin 2926                                 -- Ozzie Togglevolt

step Kharanos: Ozzie's next quest
  when done gno-start
  when group 2962
  when turnedin 2926
  zone Dun Morogh
  accept 2962                                 -- Ozzie Togglevolt: then back to the portal

step Gnomeregan: before going in
  when done gno-start
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Group of 5 at 29 to 33. Everything inside is elite and the mechanical foes hit hard.
  note In the quest log before going in: The Grand Betrayal, Data Rescue and Save Techbot's Brain! (Tinker Town). If you took them: Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators (Shoni the Shilent, Stormwind, Group 9), Essential Artificials (Klockmort Spannerspan, Tinker Town), The Only Cure is More Green Glow (Ozzie, Kharanos). Bring the Yellow Punch Card (or the White one), and 3 silver per Grime-Encrusted Object you want to put in the Sparklematic 5200.
  goto 24.3,39.8 "Gnomeregan" r 25

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: what drops all through the dungeon sits in one along step (it never
# holds the route), up to Thermaplugg; the machines and NPCs come in the order of the rooms.
step Gnomeregan: along the way
  when done gno-start
  along until gno-thermaplugg
  tip Collected all through the dungeon. Robo-mechanical Guts (24 for Shoni): the troggs, slimes, leper gnomes and machines. Essential Artificials: the Artificial Extrapolators, rectangular boxes on the floor all around the dungeon; each one vanishes once used, so a full group on the quest may have to search the whole dungeon. Every player with the quest loots their own.
  note Share the quests with your group: click each in the quest log, then Share.
  collect 9309 quest 2928 optional            -- Robo-mechanical Guts
  collect 9278 x12 quest 2924 optional        -- Essential Artificial: Artificial Extrapolators
  collect 9365 quest 2962 optional            -- High Potency Radioactive Fallout: the heavy phial, on a living irradiated slime or horror
  accept 2945 item 9326 optional              -- Grime-Encrusted Ring, a drop from the Dark Iron Agents: right-click it

step Gnomeregan: the Sparklematic, the Dormitory and the Clean Room
  when done gno-start
  tip The Sparklematic 5200 machines stand in the room before the Dormitory: put the Grime-Encrusted Ring in one to clean it. In the Dormitory, Kernobee waits before the Viscous Fallout room: his escort runs all the way back to the dungeon's entrance; near the end a countdown starts, get him out before it reaches zero. His reward waits at Booty Bay, on the route of Group 15. Matrix Punchograph 3005-B, in the Dormitory south of the Clean Room, turns the Yellow card into a Blue one.
  kill 7079                                   -- Viscous Fallout, in the Clean Room
  collect 9282 optional                       -- Blue Punch Card: the Yellow one, at Matrix Punchograph 3005-B
  turnin 2945 object 142487 optional          -- The Sparklematic 5200
  accept 2947 object 142487 optional          -- Return of the Ring: for Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge
  accept 2904 optional                        -- Kernobee
  complete 2904 optional                      -- Escort Kernobee back to the entrance

step Gnomeregan: the Launch Bay
  when done gno-start
  tip Electrocutioner 6000 stands on the Launch Bay platform; Matrix Punchograph 3005-C, on the same platform, turns the Blue card into a Red one.
  kill 6235                                   -- Electrocutioner 6000
  collect 9281 optional                       -- Red Punch Card: the Blue one, at Matrix Punchograph 3005-C

step Gnomeregan: the Engineering Labs
  when done gno-start
  tip The Crowd Pummeler 9-60 fights in the Engineering Labs; Matrix Punchograph 3005-D, on the lower level of that room, turns the Red card into the Prismatic Punch Card.
  kill 6229                                   -- Crowd Pummeler 9-60
  collect 9316 quest 2930                     -- Prismatic Punch Card: the Red one, at Matrix Punchograph 3005-D

step Gnomeregan: Mekgineer Thermaplugg
  label gno-thermaplugg
  when done gno-start
  tip The last boss. Tank Thermaplugg (elite 34) in the middle of the room: his Walking Bombs then take longer to reach the group; ranged players kill them. They come faster at half health and faster still at 20 %. Overwhelmed? A button on the pillars around the room stops them for a while: give that job to one ranged player. After each knock-back his threat resets: let the tank take him back.
  kill 7800 quest 2929                        -- Mekgineer Thermaplugg

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: each hand-in has its own step, for whoever holds the quest ready to
# hand in (`when complete`): nothing waits for a quest a player could not finish.
step Kharanos: Ozzie Togglevolt
  when complete 2926
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Out of Gnomeregan and east to Kharanos, on the way back to Ironforge.
  turnin 2926                                 -- Ozzie Togglevolt

step Kharanos: Ozzie Togglevolt (Green Glow)
  when complete 2962
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Out of Gnomeregan and east to Kharanos, within the two hours of the fallout.
  turnin 2962                                 -- Ozzie Togglevolt

step Tinker Town: High Tinker Mekkatorque
  when complete 2929
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2929                                 -- High Tinker Mekkatorque

step Tinker Town: Master Mechanic Castpipe
  when complete 2930
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2930                                 -- Master Mechanic Castpipe

step Tinker Town: Tinkmaster Overspark
  when complete 2922
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2922                                 -- Tinkmaster Overspark

step Tinker Town: Klockmort Spannerspan
  when complete 2924
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2924                                 -- Klockmort Spannerspan

step Mystic Ward: Talvash del Kissel
  when complete 2947
  zone Ironforge
  tip Return of the Ring: Talvash del Kissel is in the Mystic Ward. His next quest, Gnome Improvement, asks for a Silver Bar and a Moss Agate: not in the guide.
  turnin 2947                                 -- Talvash del Kissel

step Stormwind: Shoni the Shilent
  when complete 2928
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind: Shoni is in the Dwarven District, by the tram. Group 11 (Dalaran) starts in Stormwind.
  turnin 2928                                 -- Shoni the Shilent
